  "html": "<div class=\"wrap top-in\">\n    <a class=\"logo-link\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Birdline home\"><img class=\"logo-img\" src=\"/img/birdline-wordmark-white.457eb4ae.webp\" width=\"273\" height=\"72\" alt=\"Birdline\"></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\" id=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Site\">\n      <div class=\"nav-item\"><a href=\"/work\" data-page=\"/work\" aria-haspopup=\"true\">Work<svg class=\"nav-caret\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 8l5 5 5-5\"></path></svg></a><button class=\"nav-acc\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"menu-work\">Work<svg class=\"nav-caret\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 8l5 5 5-5\"></path></svg></button>\n        <div class=\"menu menu--work\" id=\"menu-work\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Work\">\n          <!-- the phone sheet's own first rows (hidden on desktop, where the lead card carries these) -->\n          <div class=\"menu-top\"><a class=\"menu-top-all\" href=\"/work\" data-page=\"/work\">All Work<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/case-studies\" data-page=\"/case-studies\">All case studies<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a></div>\n          <div class=\"wrap menu-in\">\n            <div class=\"menu-lead\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Work</span><b class=\"menu-title\">The partnerships, and the work behind them.</b><p>Case studies with the numbers that came out of them, and the reel of commercials, social, photography and design they produced.</p><div class=\"menu-ctas\"><a class=\"menu-all\" href=\"/case-studies\" data-page=\"/case-studies\">All case studies<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-all\" href=\"/work\" data-page=\"/work\">See all the work<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a></div></div>\n            <div class=\"menu-cols\">\n              <div class=\"menu-g menu-g--2\"><b>Case studies</b><div class=\"menu-2col\"><div>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/whoop\" data-page=\"/case-studies/whoop\"><span>WHOOP</span><small>From a social series to a full partnership</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/gardyn\" data-page=\"/case-studies/gardyn\"><span>Gardyn</span><small>45M+ organic views</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/literati\" data-page=\"/case-studies/literati\"><span>Literati</span><small>An always-on creative pipeline</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/solidroad\" data-page=\"/case-studies/solidroad\"><span>Solidroad</span><small>50+ pieces from one two-day shoot</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/686\" data-page=\"/case-studies/686\"><span>686</span><small>Recurring shoots, weekly post-production</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/route\" data-page=\"/case-studies/route\"><span>Route</span><small>Paid social, on time and on concept</small></a>\n              </div><div>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/freepower\" data-page=\"/case-studies/freepower\"><span>FreePower</span><small>15M views, 170K clicks</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/public-rec\" data-page=\"/case-studies/public-rec\"><span>Public Rec</span><small>$53M+ in tracked revenue</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/willies-remedy\" data-page=\"/case-studies/willies-remedy\"><span>Willie’s Remedy</span><small>A three-episode explainer series</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/patrol\" data-page=\"/case-studies/patrol\"><span>Patrol</span><small>12M views in one week</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/edjy\" data-page=\"/case-studies/edjy\"><span>EDJY</span><small>From one launch to a full video engine</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/ufl\" data-page=\"/case-studies/ufl\"><span>UFL</span><small>A full season of content, at game speed</small></a>\n              </div></div></div>\n              <div class=\"menu-g\"><b>The work</b>\n                <a href=\"/work\" data-page=\"/work\"><span>Showreel</span><small>Our Birds’ work, featured</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/work#tv-commercial\" data-page=\"/work#tv-commercial\"><span>Commercial</span><small>Hero spots and brand films</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/work#tv-social\" data-page=\"/work#tv-social\"><span>Paid &amp; Social</span><small>Paid ads, UGC and social cuts</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/work#tv-photo\" data-page=\"/work#tv-photo\"><span>Photography</span><small>Stills from our shoots</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/work#tv-design\" data-page=\"/work#tv-design\"><span>Design &amp; animation</span><small>Statics, posts and key art</small></a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"nav-item\"><a href=\"/services\" data-page=\"/services\" aria-haspopup=\"true\">Services<svg class=\"nav-caret\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 8l5 5 5-5\"></path></svg></a><button class=\"nav-acc\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"menu-services\">Services<svg class=\"nav-caret\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 8l5 5 5-5\"></path></svg></button>\n        <div class=\"menu\" id=\"menu-services\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Services\">\n          <div class=\"menu-top\"><a class=\"menu-top-all\" href=\"/services\" data-page=\"/services\">All Services<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/services/production-process\" data-page=\"/services/production-process\">Our Production Process<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a></div>\n          <div class=\"wrap menu-in\">\n            <div class=\"menu-lead\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Services</span><b class=\"menu-title\">Many ways to make it, one team.</b><p>Every format a campaign needs, from one team inside one workspace. Request any of them on the Monthly Partnership, or scope a production on its own.</p><div class=\"menu-ctas\"><a class=\"menu-all\" href=\"/services\" data-page=\"/services\">All services<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-all\" href=\"/services/production-process\" data-page=\"/services/production-process\">Our Production Process<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a></div></div>\n            <div class=\"menu-cols\">\n              <div class=\"menu-g\"><b>Video</b>\n                <a href=\"/services/commercial\" data-page=\"/services/commercial\"><span>Commercial</span><small>Hero spots and brand films</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/paid-social\" data-page=\"/services/paid-social\"><span>Paid Social</span><small>Ads for Meta, TikTok, and YouTube</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/ugc\" data-page=\"/services/ugc\"><span>UGC</span><small>Creator-style video for the feed</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/ctv\" data-page=\"/services/ctv\"><span>CTV</span><small>Spots cut for connected TV</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/profiles\" data-page=\"/services/profiles\"><span>Profiles</span><small>Docu-series and long-form YouTube</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/video-podcasts\" data-page=\"/services/video-podcasts\"><span>Video Podcasts</span><small>Multi-cam shoots, cut for every feed</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/film\" data-page=\"/services/film\"><span>Film</span><small>Shot on 8mm, 16mm and 35mm</small></a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"menu-g\"><b>Design & motion</b>\n                <a href=\"/services/design\" data-page=\"/services/design\"><span>Design</span><small>Statics, landing pages, email</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/motion-graphics\" data-page=\"/services/motion-graphics\"><span>Motion Graphics</span><small>Animation, titles, explainers</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/3d-vfx\" data-page=\"/services/3d-vfx\"><span>3D / VFX</span><small>Renders, worlds, compositing</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/illustration\" data-page=\"/services/illustration\"><span>Illustrations</span><small>Drawings and character work</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/ai-content\" data-page=\"/services/ai-content\"><span>AI Content</span><small>Generative visuals and audio</small></a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"menu-g\"><b>Photo, audio & OOH</b>\n                <a href=\"/services/photography\" data-page=\"/services/photography\"><span>Photography</span><small>Product, lifestyle, campaign stills</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/audio\" data-page=\"/services/audio\"><span>Audio</span><small>Radio spots to podcasts</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/ooh\" data-page=\"/services/ooh\"><span>OOH</span><small>Events, stadiums, offices</small></a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"/production-workspace\" data-page=\"/production-workspace\">Birdline App<i class=\"nav-new\">New</i></a>\n      <a href=\"/packages\" data-page=\"/packages\">Packages</a>\n      <a href=\"/about\" data-page=\"/about\">About</a>\n      <div class=\"nav-foot\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://calendly.com/birdlinestudios/birdline-exploratory-call\" data-book>Book a call</a><a class=\"btn btn--outline nav-login\" href=\"https://app.birdline.ai/login\">Log in</a></div>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"top-cta\">\n      <a class=\"top-link\" href=\"https://app.birdline.ai/login\">Log in</a>\n      <!-- every \"Book a call\" / \"Book a demo\" opens the booking modal (script.js, [data-book]); without script it goes straight to Calendly -->\n      <a class=\"btn btn--sm\" href=\"https://calendly.com/birdlinestudios/birdline-exploratory-call\" data-book>Book a call</a>\n      <button class=\"menu-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"site-nav\" data-menu>\n        <svg class=\"ic-bars\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg>\n        <svg class=\"ic-x\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"></path></svg>\n        <span>Menu</span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
 },
 "footer": {
  "tag": "footer",
  "attrs": {
   "className": "foot on-dark"
  },
  "html": "<div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"foot-grid\">\n      <div class=\"foot-brand\">\n        <a class=\"logo-link\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Birdline home\"><img class=\"logo-img\" src=\"/img/birdline-wordmark-white.457eb4ae.webp\" width=\"273\" height=\"72\" alt=\"Birdline\"></a>\n        <p>Get premium content every month—on demand, on brand, and streamlined through our production workspace.</p>\n      </div>\n      <nav class=\"foot-col\" aria-label=\"Services\">\n        <b>Services</b>\n        <a href=\"/services/commercial\" data-page=\"/services/commercial\">Commercial</a>\n        <a href=\"/services/paid-social\" data-page=\"/services/paid-social\">Paid Social</a>\n        <a href=\"/services/ugc\" data-page=\"/services/ugc\">UGC</a>\n        <a href=\"/services/ctv\" data-page=\"/services/ctv\">CTV</a>\n        <a href=\"/services/profiles\" data-page=\"/services/profiles\">Profiles</a>\n        <a href=\"/services\" data-page=\"/services\">View all</a>\n      </nav>\n      <nav class=\"foot-col\" aria-label=\"Company\">\n        <b>Company</b>\n        <a href=\"/work\" data-page=\"/work\">Work</a>\n        <a href=\"/case-studies\" data-page=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a>\n        <a href=\"/packages\" data-page=\"/packages\">Packages</a>\n        <a href=\"/how-it-works\" data-page=\"/how-it-works\">How It Works</a>\n        <a href=\"/testimonials\" data-page=\"/testimonials\">Testimonials</a>\n        <a href=\"/about\" data-page=\"/about\">About</a>\n      </nav>\n      <nav class=\"foot-col\" aria-label=\"Product\">\n        <b>Birdline App</b>\n        <a href=\"/production-workspace\" data-page=\"/production-workspace\">Production Workspace</a>\n        <a href=\"/rops\" data-page=\"/rops\"><span>ROPS<sup class=\"mark-tm\">™</sup> &amp; ROCS<sup class=\"mark-tm\">™</sup></span></a>\n        <a href=\"https://app.birdline.ai/login?mode=signup\">Start free trial</a>\n        <a href=\"https://app.birdline.ai/login\">Log in</a>\n        <a href=\"/support\">Support</a>\n        <a href=\"/#faq\">FAQ</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n    <!-- the legal line on the left, the social icons on the right (November 9, 2026) -->\n    <div class=\"foot-legal\">\n      <div class=\"foot-legal-l\">\n        <span>© 2026 Mike Pagan Studio Inc.</span>\n        <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy Policy</a>\n        <a href=\"/terms\">Terms of Service</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"foot-social\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/birdlinestudios/\" aria-label=\"Birdline on Instagram\" title=\"Instagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"5\"></rect><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"></circle></svg></a>\n        <!-- TODO: confirm the LinkedIn page URL. -->\n        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/birdlinestudios/\" aria-label=\"Birdline on LinkedIn\" title=\"LinkedIn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 8.75A1.75 1.75 0 1 0 6.5 5.25a1.75 1.75 0 0 0 0 3.5ZM5 10.25h3v8.5H5v-8.5Zm5.25 0h2.9v1.2c.5-.85 1.55-1.45 3-1.45 2.9 0 3.6 1.9 3.6 4.4v4.35h-3v-3.9c0-1.05-.05-2.35-1.5-2.35-1.45 0-1.95 1.1-1.95 2.3v3.95h-3v-8.5Z\"></path></svg></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
 },
 "lightbox": {
  "tag": "dialog",
  "attrs": {
   "className": "lb",
   "data-lb-dialog": "",
   "aria-label": "Media viewer"
  },
  "html": "<div class=\"lb-in\">\n    <div class=\"lb-top\"><div class=\"lb-meta\"><b data-lb-title></b><span><em data-lb-kind></em><i data-lb-count></i></span></div>\n      <button class=\"lb-x\" type=\"button\" data-lb-close><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"></path></svg><span>Close</span></button></div>\n    <div class=\"lb-stage\"><button class=\"lb-nav lb-nav--prev\" type=\"button\" data-lb-prev aria-label=\"Previous\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 6l-6 6 6 6\"></path></svg></button>\n      <div class=\"lb-frame\" data-lb-body></div>\n      <button class=\"lb-nav lb-nav--next\" type=\"button\" data-lb-next aria-label=\"Next\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6l6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></button></div>\n    <div class=\"lb-rail\" data-lb-rail role=\"list\" aria-label=\"More in this gallery\"></div>\n  </div>"
 },
 "book": {
  "tag": "dialog",
  "attrs": {
   "className": "book",
   "data-book-dialog": "",
   "aria-labelledby": "book-title"
  },
  "html": "<div class=\"book-card\">\n    <button class=\"book-x\" type=\"button\" data-book-close aria-label=\"Close\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"></path></svg></button>\n    <div class=\"book-step\" data-book-step=\"form\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Book a call</span>\n      <h2 class=\"book-h\" id=\"book-title\">Let’s Scale Your <span class=\"nowrap\">Content Library.</span></h2>\n      <form class=\"lead\" data-lead data-book-form novalidate>\n        <div class=\"lead-row\">\n          <label for=\"book-name\">Full name *<input id=\"book-name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"name\" required></label>\n          <label for=\"book-email\">Work email *<input id=\"book-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" inputmode=\"email\" required data-work-email></label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lead-row\">\n          <label for=\"book-company\">Company name *<input id=\"book-company\" name=\"company\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"organization\" required></label>\n          <label for=\"book-size\">Company size *<select id=\"book-size\" name=\"size\" required><option value=\"\">Select…</option><option>1-10</option><option>11-50</option><option>51-200</option><option>201-500</option><option>501-1000</option><option>1000+</option></select></label>\n        </div>\n        <label for=\"book-source\">How did you hear about Birdline?<select id=\"book-source\" name=\"source\" data-source><option value=\"\">Select…</option><option>Referral</option><option>LinkedIn</option><option>Instagram or TikTok</option><option>Google search</option><option>Saw your work for a brand</option><option>Podcast or newsletter</option><option>An event</option><option>Other</option></select></label>\n        <label class=\"book-other\" for=\"book-source-other\" hidden>Tell us more<input id=\"book-source-other\" name=\"source_other\" type=\"text\" data-source-other></label>\n        <label class=\"hp\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Website<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label>\n        <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Pick a time</button>\n        <p class=\"lead-msg\" data-lead-msg aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"book-step\" data-book-step=\"calendar\" hidden>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Pick a time</span>\n      <h2 class=\"book-h\">Thanks<span data-book-first></span>. Choose a time that suits you.</h2>\n      <div class=\"book-cal\"><iframe title=\"Book a time with Birdline\" data-book-cal></iframe></div>\n      <p class=\"book-fine\">Calendar not showing? <a href=\"https://calendly.com/birdlinestudios/birdline-exploratory-call\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-book-cal-link>Open it in a new tab</a>.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
 }
}